WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:07.382
We are elated to win.

00:00:07.382 --> 00:00:11.386
This is for the community of
Harlem past, present and future.

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:12.929
It's just an amazing night.

00:00:12.929 --> 00:00:15.140
And this whole journey
has been great

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:18.601
from the Sundance Film Festival
through the Academy Awards.

00:00:18.893 --> 00:00:20.311
Also, Ahmir said 
this in his speech,

00:00:20.311 --> 00:00:22.397
it just was an incredible year
for documentaries.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:25.650
It's just incredible
to be recognized amongst that

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:29.571
group of films and really feel
a part of that filmmaking

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:30.447
community this year.

00:00:31.072 --> 00:00:32.615
I've been Questlove
for 30 years,

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:35.994
and if you could tell the person
that used to busk

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:38.997
for change on South 
Street in Philadelphia

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:44.502
where his life is headed
in the next 25 years. Wow.

00:00:44.961 --> 00:00:46.296
Hang on. Hold on.

